// input_forms.rin — وضع النموذج لكائن class وstruct وقاموس (set المعرّفة في الصنف تُحترم، والتجميد يفشل قبل السؤال)
class Person {
    let name = "Ali";
    let age = 30;
    let active = false;
    let nick = nil;
    set age(v) { }
}
struct Pt { let x = 1; let y = 2; }
let p = Person();
let back = input("P> ", p);
print p.name + "," + p.age + "," + p.active + "," + (back == p);
let pt = Pt();
input("Pt> ", pt);
print pt.x + pt.y;
let cfg = {"host": "localhost", "port": 80, "tls": false};
let c2 = input("cfg> ", cfg);
print c2.host + ":" + c2.port + ":" + c2.tls;
oop.freeze(p);
input("again> ", p);
